This product includes software developed by the OpenKH project
(https://github.com/OpenKH/OpenKh), Copyright 2019-2026 OpenKH Team and
Contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0. OpenKH is consumed as a
git submodule and its prebuilt Panacea mod loader is downloaded from official
OpenKH releases at runtime.

At runtime this product also downloads, and does not redistribute:

- LuaBackend (https://github.com/Sirius902/LuaBackend), from its official releases.
- Mods the user asks for, including Garden of Assemblage ROM Edition
  (https://github.com/KH2FM-Mods-Num/GoA-ROM-Edition) and Re:Fined
  (https://github.com/KH-ReFined/KH-ReFined). These remain the work and property
  of their authors, under their own terms.
- The KH2 Tracker (https://github.com/Dee-Ayy/KH2Tracker), when the user opens it.
- The KH2 Randomizer seed generator source
  (https://github.com/tommadness/KH2Randomizer) and a self-contained Python from
  python-build-standalone (https://github.com/astral-sh/python-build-standalone,
  MPL-2.0), when the user installs the generator.
- Microsoft .NET redistributables, from Microsoft, when a feature needs them
  inside the Wine bottle.

This product bundles no third-party binaries. Its own dependencies are Avalonia
(MIT) and LibGit2Sharp (MIT).

This project is not affiliated with Square Enix or Disney. It does not
distribute any game assets; it operates on the user's own legally purchased
copy of KINGDOM HEARTS HD 1.5+2.5 ReMIX.
